      "rdfs:label": [
        "[\"atConservatoryDuring\",\"liane\",\"floodWinter\"]",
        "The night porter remembers the flood winter well: the copy-room lamps burned past midnight, week upon week, and it was the archive girl, Liane, who kept them burning."
      ],
