          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/cd30fd7e3f163455ed61"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_batch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_hand",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "Set beside her ledger entries, the draft's corrections show the same hand: the strokes that cross out and rewrite are Liane's."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/2b5effb11a9187633f86"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_hand"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_heardOnly",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "Mistress Odile knows the tune at one hearing: the Vara cradle-song, never printed, never performed, sung only within that house's walls."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/78f7fb3cffd3f1e8e202"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_heardOnly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_ink",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "The draft's ink is the copy-room's own iron-gall — the galley batch, mixed with flood-silted water; it greys at the stroke's edge like no other."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/efda75cef80d6c945785"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_ink"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_ledger",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "The copy-room ledger's winter pages carry the same initials line after line: Liane signed in through the whole of the flood winter."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/41754b8603ae13086b92"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_ledger"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_porter",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "The night porter remembers the flood winter well: the copy-room lamps burned past midnight, week upon week, and it was the archive girl, Liane, who kept them burning."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/7dfbbd2a34c5f08ab7e6"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_porter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_quotes",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "Played through once, the nocturne gives up its middle voice: it carries an older tune entire — a cradle-song, set like a keepsake under the right hand's figures."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/6917f1b6d61d56716299"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_quotes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_stock",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "The steward's stock-book is plain: heron paper entered the copy-room in the winter of the flood, and the last of it was spent before the thaw. None before, none since."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/ec6ea64363c34603f0d7"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_stock"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_ward",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "Liane was raised within the Vara house — the music-master's orphan, taken in as ward; she grew up under that roof and under its songs."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/a8650e9576ba7f22a616"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_ward"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/premise/p_watermark",
      "@type": [
        "ms:AuthoredPremise",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        "Held to the lamp, every leaf of the nocturne shows the same heron watermark — the Brell mill's mark."
      ],
      "ms:describesFact": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/fact/9aed125bb9e1f25cbaca"
        }
      ],
      "ms:premiseId": [
        "p_watermark"
      ]
    },
